name  Test Arena
theme facility
spawn 3.5 9.5 0
entity i imp
entity c crystal
# A6 demo: the lower pen's door wants a key nobody on this map holds (walk up
# and F it for the refusal), the top pen's west wall slides when pushed (F on
# it from the outside), and standing inside that pen scores the secret.
lock 14 11 key.red
pushwall 4 5 -1 0 1
secret 3 2 7 6 imp pen
# Hand-authored counterpart to the procedural generator. Everything below the
# separator is the level: edit it in any text editor and reload with TAB.
#
# Two things this map exists to prove. The pillars at the centre give a sprite
# something to hide behind, so per-column z-buffer occlusion is visible rather
# than merely asserted. And the imps are placed facing across open floor, so
# strafing around one shows its angle bucket change.
